WEBVTT

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:08.770
<b>Meiji Tokyo Renka</b>

00:01:34.620 --> 00:01:35.900
Get back, Koizumi!

00:01:39.870 --> 00:01:41.230
There you are, spirit!

00:01:41.810 --> 00:01:43.010
Fujita-san!

00:01:49.980 --> 00:01:51.210
Jane...

00:01:59.260 --> 00:02:02.100
<b>Caught in the Ghost Hotel</b>

00:02:12.330 --> 00:02:13.320
W-W-Wha?!

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:16.320
This is the most delicious 
dessert in the world:

00:02:16.320 --> 00:02:18.150
sweet bun with tea and rice.

00:02:19.660 --> 00:02:22.150
You break the sweet bun into pieces 
with your chopsticks like so,

00:02:22.150 --> 00:02:26.410
getting the sweet red bean paste 
onto each and every grain of rice.

00:02:29.050 --> 00:02:30.040
Fumi-san.

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:30.920
Yes, sir.

00:02:31.240 --> 00:02:33.170
Here, Little Squirrel.

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:39.210
It's good, isn't it?

00:02:39.650 --> 00:02:40.640
Syunso.

00:02:40.640 --> 00:02:41.700
Yes?

00:02:41.700 --> 00:02:43.710
I have enough for you, too.

00:02:43.710 --> 00:02:45.170
No, I'm fine...

00:02:45.170 --> 00:02:47.060
Don't be shy now.

00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:49.470
Come on, say ah.

00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:59.770
Meow, meow...

00:02:59.770 --> 00:03:01.760
C'mere, black kitty.

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:04.860
I can still taste it.

00:03:04.860 --> 00:03:07.080
He even made me have some.

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:08.830
Anyway...

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:10.320
What's that?

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:13.230
Oh, it's katsuobushi.

00:03:13.230 --> 00:03:14.820
I borrowed it from Fumi-san.

00:03:14.820 --> 00:03:17.510
And you're going to find 
the black cat with that?

00:03:18.820 --> 00:03:21.520
I should be able to, right?

00:03:21.520 --> 00:03:24.150
Don't cats like katsuobushi?

00:03:24.150 --> 00:03:25.700
Even ghost cats?

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:30.280
A ghost cat should still like it, 
since it's a cat, shouldn't it?

00:03:30.280 --> 00:03:31.760
I wouldn't know.

00:03:31.760 --> 00:03:34.860
Besides, can you find it
 during the day?

00:03:35.170 --> 00:03:38.820
I heard you can't see ghosts 
unless it is the dark hours.

00:03:38.820 --> 00:03:40.400
Dark hours?

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:43.020
It's the time between dusk and dawn.

00:03:43.480 --> 00:03:46.130
You're a Tamayori and you 
don't even know that?

00:03:46.130 --> 00:03:49.550
Ah, no. I had no idea.

00:03:50.350 --> 00:03:52.910
What should we do now, then?

00:03:53.720 --> 00:03:54.870
I'm going back.

00:03:55.760 --> 00:03:58.830
Please, I'm begging you, Izumi-san.

00:03:58.830 --> 00:04:01.000
I told you, I can't do it.

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:05.200
Please, I have nothing without your help!

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:06.620
You're so annoying.

00:04:06.620 --> 00:04:07.500
Izumi.

00:04:08.990 --> 00:04:12.110
Oh, Hishida-san. And what's this?

00:04:12.110 --> 00:04:14.330
This girl would be the one

00:04:14.780 --> 00:04:18.910
I met at the Rokumeikan. Umm...

00:04:18.910 --> 00:04:21.320
pardon me, but what is your name?

00:04:21.320 --> 00:04:23.050
Ayazuki Mei.

00:04:23.050 --> 00:04:27.250
And you are, uh, Yakumo-san and Kyoka-san.

00:04:27.250 --> 00:04:30.040
Wow, you remembered who I am!

00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:32.240
I am so moved!

00:04:32.240 --> 00:04:36.540
The Western-style short skirt from 
the other evening was splendid,

00:04:37.260 --> 00:04:39.720
but you're beautiful in 
Japanese clothing as well.

00:04:39.720 --> 00:04:42.090
Oh, you're the weird girl from before.

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:43.290
Weird girl?

00:04:44.180 --> 00:04:45.040
Huh?

00:04:45.600 --> 00:04:48.920
W-What? Stop staring at me.

00:04:48.920 --> 00:04:52.320
It's not with you today? 
The rabbit from that night.

00:04:56.410 --> 00:04:59.030
So you are one.

00:05:00.270 --> 00:05:04.800
Koizumi-san, you should have 
this girl handle your request.

00:05:04.800 --> 00:05:07.720
Have Mei-san do it?

00:05:07.720 --> 00:05:08.730
Why?

00:05:08.730 --> 00:05:11.160
Because apparently she's also a Tamayori.

00:05:11.160 --> 00:05:13.510
What?! Is that true?

00:05:13.510 --> 00:05:15.440
Ah, yes, most likely.

00:05:15.840 --> 00:05:18.580
Wait... You're one too, Kyoka-san?

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:20.650
I told you to stay back!

00:05:20.650 --> 00:05:23.590
Then that means that rabbit is a ghost,

00:05:23.590 --> 00:05:26.540
and that's why I can't 
see it during the day!

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:31.930
Mei-san, please let me rent your powers!

00:05:31.930 --> 00:05:32.810
Eh?!

00:05:32.810 --> 00:05:36.430
It is truly destiny that I have met 
a Tamayori like you!

00:05:36.430 --> 00:05:39.320
Please, I want you to help me see Jane again.

00:05:40.220 --> 00:05:41.320
Jane?

00:05:44.060 --> 00:05:45.240
Essentially,

00:05:46.060 --> 00:05:50.810
you wish to have Mei catch 
this ghost known as Jane?

00:05:50.810 --> 00:05:53.850
No, I don't want to catch her,

00:05:53.850 --> 00:05:57.140
I just want to speak with her.

00:05:57.140 --> 00:05:59.840
She is a childhood friend of mine.

00:06:00.480 --> 00:06:02.960
You're friends with a ghost?

00:06:02.960 --> 00:06:04.150
Yes.

00:06:04.150 --> 00:06:09.770
Mei-san, when I was younger, I was 
able to see ghosts like you can.

00:06:09.770 --> 00:06:11.580
You were, Yakumo-san?

00:06:11.580 --> 00:06:14.100
Yes. Jane...

00:06:14.490 --> 00:06:20.110
She and I got along so well, it was almost 
like we were brother and sister.

00:06:20.110 --> 00:06:24.030
It doesn't matter whether 
she is a ghost or not.

00:06:24.370 --> 00:06:30.720
My parents divorced when I was very 
young. I always felt lonely,

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:33.620
and she was the only 
emotional support I had.

00:06:33.920 --> 00:06:36.550
But then, one day...

00:06:34.020 --> 00:06:37.410
Eight, nine, ten!

00:06:37.810 --> 00:06:39.550
Ready or not, here I come!

00:06:39.550 --> 00:06:44.400
Say, Patrick, do you think 
you can find the real me?

00:06:44.400 --> 00:06:45.760
The real you?

00:06:45.760 --> 00:06:49.950
But, if you do find me, you might hate me.

00:06:49.950 --> 00:06:52.130
I would never hate you!

00:06:52.480 --> 00:06:53.780
You mean it?

00:06:54.890 --> 00:06:56.070
Jane!

00:06:56.400 --> 00:06:58.150
Found you!

00:07:05.240 --> 00:07:07.030
P-Patrick...

00:07:10.320 --> 00:07:11.880
Patrick...

00:07:20.760 --> 00:07:21.740
Jane?

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:24.890
Jane?!

00:07:28.170 --> 00:07:30.130
Jane!

00:07:31.890 --> 00:07:34.100
It was terrible for me to scream like that

00:07:34.100 --> 00:07:37.130
upon seeing her face, 
even if I had been startled.

00:07:38.190 --> 00:07:40.620
I tried to apologize immediately,

00:07:41.180 --> 00:07:47.290
but I lost one of my eyes in an 
accident soon after that incident.

00:07:48.020 --> 00:07:52.610
I have not been able to 
see ghosts ever since.

00:07:53.260 --> 00:07:57.100
What happened that day has long 
since plagued my thoughts.

00:07:57.490 --> 00:08:00.150
For all this time.

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:04.030
However, since the red 
full moon the other night,

00:08:04.030 --> 00:08:07.340
strange things have frequently 
been happening around me.

00:08:07.340 --> 00:08:09.720
Since the night of the red full moon?

00:08:20.590 --> 00:08:23.590
Oh, a poltergeist?

00:08:23.590 --> 00:08:24.860
Wonderful!

00:08:25.220 --> 00:08:28.430
As a researcher of the paranomal,

00:08:25.740 --> 00:08:28.870
Oh! Amazing!

00:08:28.430 --> 00:08:30.870
I was happy to see 
these things, at first.

00:08:31.510 --> 00:08:33.000
But then...

00:08:44.930 --> 00:08:45.920
Jane!

00:08:46.240 --> 00:08:47.670
There you are, spirit!

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:48.500
Wait!

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:54.920
Those incidents were caused 
by Jane's wrath against me.

00:08:55.590 --> 00:08:58.030
I want to apologize to Jane.

00:08:58.030 --> 00:09:02.300
If her anger is such that 
she wishes to kill me,

00:09:02.300 --> 00:09:04.510
then I want to answer for that.

00:09:04.870 --> 00:09:06.520
What are you talking about?!

00:09:07.040 --> 00:09:11.780
Mei-san, ghosts cannot 
be seen by just anyone.

00:09:12.250 --> 00:09:16.710
That is why those who <i>can</i> see them 
are incredibly precious to them,

00:09:17.300 --> 00:09:23.030
since there are ghosts who have spent 
hundreds, even thousands, of years all alone.

00:09:23.030 --> 00:09:30.410
Nevertheless, I hurt her and then lost 
my eye through my own carelessness.

00:09:31.190 --> 00:09:35.290
Losing my sight was tantamount 
to Jane disappearing.

00:09:36.310 --> 00:09:37.640
Yakumo-san...

00:09:39.080 --> 00:09:40.690
I understand your situation.

00:09:41.130 --> 00:09:42.760
However, Koizumi-san, my apologies,

00:09:42.760 --> 00:09:45.810
but I cannot allow my fiancée 
to do something so—

00:09:45.810 --> 00:09:47.810
Okay, I'll help you!

00:09:47.810 --> 00:09:50.460
Wha? What are you saying, Mei?

00:09:50.460 --> 00:09:52.820
I can't just neglect him!

00:09:53.770 --> 00:09:56.060
I would love to help, if you'll allow me.

00:09:58.510 --> 00:09:59.920
Mei-san...

00:10:09.070 --> 00:10:10.410
Syunso.

00:10:10.410 --> 00:10:11.280
Yes?

00:10:11.280 --> 00:10:12.980
You go with her as well.

00:10:12.980 --> 00:10:14.760
Why do I have to go?

00:10:14.760 --> 00:10:19.850
Unfortunately, I am expecting a visitor 
today and cannot go with her.

00:10:20.250 --> 00:10:24.920
I would like you, someone I can trust, 
to be her bodyguard.

00:10:24.920 --> 00:10:29.400
Understood? I just wouldn't be able to bear 
it if anything happened to my Little Squirrel.

00:10:29.400 --> 00:10:32.720
You be sure to protect her now, got it?

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:36.230
Got it.

00:10:37.690 --> 00:10:39.230
Ougai-san.

00:10:39.230 --> 00:10:41.230
Thank you, everyone!

00:10:41.650 --> 00:10:45.260
I'll finally be able to speak with Jane.

00:10:44.520 --> 00:10:45.640
You sure you got it?

00:10:45.260 --> 00:10:45.990
Yes!

00:10:45.640 --> 00:10:46.680
I really do.

00:10:53.040 --> 00:10:56.390
I would like you to order another 
iron plate from America.

00:10:56.390 --> 00:10:59.760
The previous one was ten tons, 
but this one needs to be 150 tons.

00:10:59.760 --> 00:11:01.050
Shibusawa-san...

00:11:02.550 --> 00:11:05.070
I will be in the study next door.

00:11:05.070 --> 00:11:07.190
I will call for you if 
anything paranormal happens.

00:11:07.190 --> 00:11:11.150
I would like you to please summon me 
 if anything like that happens to you.

00:11:11.150 --> 00:11:13.500
Oh, and one more thing. 
Fujita-san will be on patrol,

00:11:13.500 --> 00:11:15.570
so do your best to make 
sure he doesn't see you.

00:11:17.900 --> 00:11:19.180
<i>We're sharing the room.</i>

00:11:20.100 --> 00:11:21.960
A king-sized bed!

00:11:31.690 --> 00:11:32.580
Huh?

00:11:32.580 --> 00:11:33.380
Eh?

00:11:34.220 --> 00:11:36.130
Why are you sitting on the floor?

00:11:36.130 --> 00:11:37.490
Well...

00:11:38.080 --> 00:11:39.690
Why don't you sit here?

00:11:39.690 --> 00:11:41.530
Oh, I'm fine.

00:11:52.200 --> 00:11:53.600
By the way,

00:11:54.290 --> 00:11:58.460
what do you think about Ougai-san 
referring to you as his fiancée?

00:11:58.460 --> 00:12:00.850
What do you mean?

00:12:00.850 --> 00:12:02.570
How do you feel about it?

00:12:02.570 --> 00:12:05.120
How do I feel?

00:12:09.280 --> 00:12:12.760
<i>It surprised me, but it made me happy.</i>

00:12:16.880 --> 00:12:19.630
Never mind. You don't have to answer.

00:12:20.570 --> 00:12:21.630
Oh, okay.

00:12:30.610 --> 00:12:32.170
What's that?

00:12:32.170 --> 00:12:33.220
A ghost.

00:12:33.630 --> 00:12:36.260
Isn't it? I've never seen one before.

00:12:36.900 --> 00:12:40.130
The ones I've seen have 
been a bit more cute.

00:12:40.130 --> 00:12:41.620
Can I borrow that?

00:12:42.370 --> 00:12:44.790
They're more like this...

00:12:46.280 --> 00:12:47.210
Uh?

00:12:47.210 --> 00:12:50.750
The only thing this tells me is that you're 
definitely not a Japanese painter.

00:12:54.280 --> 00:12:58.530
I envy you, being able to see another world.

00:12:59.510 --> 00:13:03.800
If I were a Tamayori, I would paint that world.

00:13:04.540 --> 00:13:06.340
I like the dark hours.

00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:09.820
There's no noise,
 so I can focus on my paintings.

00:13:11.360 --> 00:13:14.400
You realize more clearly what truly matters.

00:13:15.550 --> 00:13:17.810
I'm sure Yakumo-san is happy

00:13:18.550 --> 00:13:20.140
just because you're here.

00:13:20.720 --> 00:13:22.270
It was the same for me,

00:13:23.010 --> 00:13:26.070
when you said you would 
help me find the black cat.

00:13:26.070 --> 00:13:29.490
At first I thought you were just 
being meddlesome, but I was happy.

00:13:30.340 --> 00:13:33.320
I honestly never thought I would paint—

00:14:14.260 --> 00:14:15.500
Mei-san!

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:16.840
Has she appeared?

00:14:16.840 --> 00:14:19.730
Th-Th-There was a brown-haired lady just now!

00:14:19.730 --> 00:14:22.560
Jane, is that you?

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:23.870
Jane!

00:14:28.560 --> 00:14:31.130
You again, girl? Is this your doing?

00:14:31.130 --> 00:14:32.260
No!

00:14:36.990 --> 00:14:38.510
So it was you.

00:14:38.510 --> 00:14:39.260
Jane!

00:14:41.630 --> 00:14:43.650
And you think you've hidden from me?

00:14:45.160 --> 00:14:46.360
Please wait!

00:14:49.770 --> 00:14:51.140
Girl...

00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:54.650
Jane-san is crying.

00:15:10.290 --> 00:15:11.310
Jane!

00:15:15.080 --> 00:15:18.590
Jane, I'm sorry. Forgive me.

00:15:18.590 --> 00:15:21.060
Please don't hurt these people.

00:15:21.390 --> 00:15:23.800
If you want to kill me, do it!

00:15:24.110 --> 00:15:25.060
Jane...

00:15:25.550 --> 00:15:31.570
I would like for you to kill me.

00:15:31.990 --> 00:15:36.590
I've done something that cannot 
be taken back, so please...

00:15:36.590 --> 00:15:39.320
Kill me, kill me...

00:15:40.180 --> 00:15:41.360
Smile.

00:15:42.570 --> 00:15:44.740
Smile, Patrick.

00:15:45.790 --> 00:15:46.990
Please.

00:15:48.830 --> 00:15:52.320
That is what Jane-san is saying.

00:15:56.600 --> 00:15:59.110
Jane is saying that?

00:16:00.760 --> 00:16:03.350
I have always been by your side,

00:16:03.780 --> 00:16:07.050
even after you injured your eye.

00:16:09.440 --> 00:16:13.160
But no matter how much I called out to you...

00:16:13.160 --> 00:16:15.290
Jane, I'm sorry.

00:16:15.290 --> 00:16:16.670
I couldn't reach you.

00:16:16.670 --> 00:16:18.730
Jane, please forgive me.

00:16:18.730 --> 00:16:21.160
It was like I was about to disappear.

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:22.870
And I spent all that time...

00:16:22.870 --> 00:16:23.910
Jane...

00:16:23.910 --> 00:16:27.690
...feeling that way for years and years.

00:16:28.180 --> 00:16:33.930
But I suddenly felt a surge of power during 
the red full moon the other night.

00:16:35.060 --> 00:16:38.480
The power to tell you how I felt.

00:16:38.920 --> 00:16:40.310
Then that...

00:16:44.240 --> 00:16:46.110
was your rage towards me.

00:16:46.110 --> 00:16:49.320
An expression of anger for what I have done.

00:16:49.560 --> 00:16:51.960
I deserve to be cursed by you, but...

00:16:51.960 --> 00:16:52.890
No.

00:16:54.160 --> 00:16:58.830
No... That was because I 
couldn't control it properly.

00:16:59.470 --> 00:17:01.900
Patrick, Patrick!

00:17:02.320 --> 00:17:04.580
Oh, amazing!

00:17:04.770 --> 00:17:07.450
Patrick, Patrick, listen to me.

00:17:13.680 --> 00:17:15.110
Patrick...

00:17:16.280 --> 00:17:17.540
I'm sorry.

00:17:17.540 --> 00:17:21.310
I thought I finally had the 
power to reach out to you,

00:17:21.310 --> 00:17:22.960
and I ended up scaring you.

00:17:23.320 --> 00:17:24.260
But...

00:17:24.680 --> 00:17:27.860
But... this girl noticed me.

00:17:29.160 --> 00:17:30.120
Me?

00:17:30.120 --> 00:17:35.030
This girl found me and subdued my powers,

00:17:35.030 --> 00:17:38.870
so I could finally speak with you like this.

00:17:45.920 --> 00:17:51.150
You know, Patrick, we got along 
better than anyone else, didn't we?

00:17:51.150 --> 00:17:55.530
We cared about each other more 
than anyone else, didn't we?

00:17:56.060 --> 00:18:00.000
So why would you think I was angry?

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:04.050
Jane, when you disappeared

00:18:05.750 --> 00:18:09.170
in front of me that day,

00:18:10.950 --> 00:18:14.700
I felt like I had done something 
 I could never take back.

00:18:17.080 --> 00:18:21.200
That was because I felt embarrassed.

00:18:22.050 --> 00:18:24.590
I was trying to test you.

00:18:25.130 --> 00:18:29.450
But I ended up tormenting you 
and I wanted to disappear.

00:18:29.850 --> 00:18:36.370
I'm sorry. I never thought that it would 
cause us to be apart for such a long time.

00:18:38.950 --> 00:18:40.370
Really?

00:18:40.840 --> 00:18:42.230
Really?

00:18:42.230 --> 00:18:44.230
That's all that was?

00:18:44.230 --> 00:18:48.280
Oh gosh, so that's all that was, Jane!

00:18:48.870 --> 00:18:52.030
Jane? Jane?

00:18:52.030 --> 00:18:54.960
I spun around, and now I've lost sight of her.

00:18:54.960 --> 00:18:56.730
Where are you, Jane? Jane!

00:18:57.020 --> 00:18:58.050
Ja—

00:19:05.590 --> 00:19:07.990
It's so warm...

00:19:09.800 --> 00:19:13.390
Jane-san is here.

00:19:16.190 --> 00:19:19.120
I always will be, forever.

00:19:19.600 --> 00:19:22.700
Even if you can't see me,

00:19:22.700 --> 00:19:26.990
I will always be near you, Patrick.

00:19:50.350 --> 00:19:51.330
Jane...

00:20:04.670 --> 00:20:07.750
Mei-san, thank you very much.

00:20:07.750 --> 00:20:10.930
Thanks to you, I was finally able 
to find something precious.

00:20:10.930 --> 00:20:15.340
Me, too. I realize now 
why your stories are so loved.

00:20:16.030 --> 00:20:19.730
The reason that stories like "Hoichi the Earless"
 and "The Snow Woman" are filled with heart,

00:20:19.730 --> 00:20:25.580
despite being scary, is because of the deep 
affection you have towards ghosts, Yakumo-san.

00:20:25.580 --> 00:20:30.350
Oh my! You have read two of my stories?

00:20:30.350 --> 00:20:32.940
Not only are you a Tamayori, but you 
are full of such extensive knowledge.

00:20:32.940 --> 00:20:34.580
You are full of surprises!

00:20:35.820 --> 00:20:40.110
W-Well... Anyway, I am also grateful to you.

00:20:40.810 --> 00:20:44.340
I feel like I've learned 
a bit more about myself.

00:20:45.660 --> 00:20:46.850
Mei-san...

00:20:46.850 --> 00:20:51.110
And that goes for you, too, Syunso-san.

00:20:52.380 --> 00:20:54.900
Thank you for what you said.

00:20:54.900 --> 00:20:57.810
I'm sure Yakumo-san is happy

00:20:57.810 --> 00:20:59.400
just because you're here.

00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:02.160
I was able to manage because of your words.

00:21:03.410 --> 00:21:04.200
Sure.

00:21:04.200 --> 00:21:06.400
Looks like things are resolved here.

00:21:06.640 --> 00:21:07.870
Ougai-san!

00:21:07.870 --> 00:21:10.690
I'd hoped to get here a bit sooner,

00:21:11.210 --> 00:21:14.410
but dealing with my visitor took 
more time than I expected.

00:21:14.410 --> 00:21:18.710
Well, now, allow me to verify that 
my fiancée is indeed all right.

00:21:21.490 --> 00:21:24.800
O-Ougai-san?

00:21:25.860 --> 00:21:30.530
I'm sorry I was late.

00:21:33.470 --> 00:21:35.820
Ougai-san...

00:21:41.710 --> 00:21:43.570
You, too, Syunso.

00:21:45.770 --> 00:21:48.320
You carried out your duty splendidly.

00:21:49.020 --> 00:21:52.180
C-Come on, please stop, Ougai-san!

00:21:52.180 --> 00:21:54.830
You should hug me back.

00:21:52.370 --> 00:21:55.310
That is how he is protecting you.

00:21:54.830 --> 00:21:56.080
I don't want to.

00:21:55.310 --> 00:21:56.080
Eh?

00:21:56.080 --> 00:21:57.400
Mori-san.

00:21:57.400 --> 00:22:00.350
Saying you are the fiancée 
of an army surgeon first class

00:22:00.350 --> 00:22:02.830
means no one can meddle with you heedlessly.

00:22:03.260 --> 00:22:06.130
Not even that man from the police's 
supernatural division.

00:22:07.270 --> 00:22:12.120
Girl, I won't show you any mercy 
if you do anything suspicious again.

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:16.090
You are loved.

00:22:16.750 --> 00:22:17.860
L-Loved?!

00:22:17.860 --> 00:22:22.350
But I would also like to devote more love to y—

00:22:22.730 --> 00:22:27.210
Now then, why don't we have a party with 
steamed buns with tea and rice to celebrate.

00:22:27.210 --> 00:22:27.930
Huh?

00:22:28.900 --> 00:22:30.070
Hey!

00:23:30.010 --> 00:23:40.010
<b>Meiji Tokyo Renka</b>

00:23:30.010 --> 00:23:40.010
Next Episode Preview

00:23:30.010 --> 00:23:40.010
Flower of Asakusa Rendezvous

00:23:31.660 --> 00:23:33.770
U-Umm... Where 
are we going?

00:23:34.130 --> 00:23:35.580
To an enjoyable place.

00:23:35.580 --> 00:23:36.510
Eh?

00:23:36.940 --> 00:23:38.850
Are you familiar with 
the flower of Asakusa?
